OL,3,ALegendary Canadian boxer George Chuvalo
OL,4,Adies aged 89
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian boxer George Chuvalo, a
OL,7,Ffive-time national heavyweight
OL,8,Fchampion, has died at the age of 89.
OL,10,FOut of 93 total professional fights in
OL,11,Fhis career - 73 victories, 18 losses,
OL,12,Fand two draws - Chuvalo was never once
OL,13,Fknocked down to the canvas.
OL,15,F"His photos have hung on our walls for
OL,16,Fdecades. His stories have been passed
OL,17,Fdown from one generation of fighters to
OL,18,Fthe next," said Sully's Boxing, the
OL,19,FToronto gym where he trained, in a
OL,20,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
