OL,3,ALegendary Canadian boxer George Chuvalo
OL,4,Adies aged 89
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe battled Muhammad Ali in 1966 and
OL,7,F1972, and though Chuvalo lost both
OL,8,Ffights, Ali called him the toughest guy
OL,9,Fhe ever fought.
